        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Deployment notes&lt;/b&gt;  MySQL icons identify logical database roles; endpoints can be local or remote and may share a host. Another Compute can share the control server/schema and GET_LOCK.&lt;br&gt;OCI shapes: Oracle Architecture Diagram Toolkit v24.2 (embedded editable stencils). Gray application components run locally; observability uses systemd, and the saved policy controls the business interval." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172B4D;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;spacing=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#475569;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
